1> be an abelian category.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The category of cochain complexes in <MATH_0002> is\nabelian.\n<STRUCT_0004> A morphism of cochain complexes\n<MATH_0003> is injective\nif and only if each <MATH_0004> is injective.\n<STRUCT_0005> A morphism of cochain complexes\n<MATH_0005> is surjective\nif and only if each <MATH_0006> is surjective.\n<STRUCT_0006> A sequence of cochain complexes\n<MATH_0007>\nis exact at <MATH_0008> if and only if each sequence\n<MATH_0009>\nis exact at <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n<STRUCT_0008>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5b54b15b0a82cafde8527239f3b646bd7642951994e6e0d3b6a225b2095e203c", "unit_id": "inventory:homology:0114:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:1d5d93cd4489b642bbbfd0d3f292b148c91fa726031198f145743ac727f22ac1", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/sites-cohomology21-gpt61sol-p102-20261109T053441Z.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:98aa046b0e0d5ec2f3411122d1565a28058194e7b456bfb1956422661fc50a33", "path": "docs/evidence/sites-cohomology21-gpt61sol-p102-20261109T053441Z-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:8d60f19ee9fe6c6edc4ee04b761654ef23c0f8f9e32067b8d73bab757eccbe6a"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": ["tag:03AO:title"], "policy_revision": "git:ace0b76a7bf22124768d632353b60dbe75d4b0f9", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "sites-cohomology21-gpt61sol-p102-20261109T053441Z", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a1beb5-b828-7092-a3e3-037f2e051a9c", "unit_id": "tag:03AO:prose-0001"}, "context_hash": "sha256:b97d47be58c89aa6e249bfbee17ac23bcd03be1afb7f550787a4977957d83519", "created_at": "2026-11-09T05:34:59.043366+00:00", "glossary_revision": "git:ace0b76a7bf22124768d632353b60dbe75d4b0f9", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.167.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.1-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.1-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-sites-cohomology21-gpt61sol-p102-20261109T053441Z", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "sites-cohomology21-gpt61sol-p102-20261109T053441Z", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:31f3bf227e5ebe2725b778511379ebcef98e3def64e249c92cf29c5f96f220e1", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "具有函子性"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Derived Categories", "target_term": "导出范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "bounded below", "target_term": "有下界"}, {"source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n警告：本节仅讨论范畴（category）上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）。在层（sheaves）及层（sheaves）的范畴（categories）的情形中，这些结果完全错误！\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002> 为靶固定的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003> 都在 <MATH_0004> 中存在。设 <MATH_0005> 为 <MATH_0006> 上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）。构造 <MATH_0007> 关于 <MATH_0008> 具有函子性（functorial）。事实上，它是函子（functor）\n<MATH_0009>；记号见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>。回忆，一个阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）中有下界（bounded below）的复形（complexes）所成的范畴（category）是阿贝尔范畴（abelian category），见《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b8eae4c5a65785108e100bc173bab60987af43834f973756f60540d900556aa4", "unit_id": "tag:03AO:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "预层及复形范畴，待批准", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "预层的系数类型，待批准", "source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"context": "本节对象，待批准", "source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "警告中的适用边界，待批准", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "层范畴，待批准", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "固定靶的族，待批准", "source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"context": "Čech 构造的条件，待批准", "source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "Čech 构造的系数，待批准", "source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "关于系数预层，待批准", "source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "具有函子性"}, {"context": "Čech 构造，待批准", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "引用章节名，待批准", "source_term": "Derived Categories", "target_term": "导出范畴"}, {"context": "复形范畴的阿贝尔性，待批准", "source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"context": "复形的有界条件，待批准", "source_term": "bounded below", "target_term": "有下界"}, {"context": "有下界复形，待批准", "source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形"}, {"context": "引用章节名，待批准", "source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调"}]}
